      "content": "I'm sorry, I didn't realize I was being too much. It's just... sometimes it feels like there's literally no point to any of it. Like I'm just taking up space and making things harder for everyone else. It feels more like an ending than a setback, you know? Like there's just no way to fix what's broken.",
